{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "tales-carried-by-the-northwind",
  "name": "Tales Carried by the Northwind",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tales_Carried_by_the_Northwind",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-03T10:35:34.700Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "vol-1",
      "label": "Vol. 1",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Silvestr Petrovich Solovei —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "VI"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Since you are kind enough to hear a dying man's shame,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Allow me to express my thanks for your gentle grace."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Still, how could the secrets of one's soul be caught in a simple phrase?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Cries of regret yield no harvest for the coming day."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Once, I too trusted the nobles' guileful tongues,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And let their hollow vows obscure my sight."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Not 'til farewell were the bitter facts wrung,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And all our shattered dreams stood bare to the light."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b8198f6af022e644"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->Why do the tombs call forth such sorrowful plight?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When comrades, homeland and my loved ones dear,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have found their rest within the endless night? No mourner disturbs their tranquil sleep."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In cold repose, like frost on waters clear,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sorrow and pain, too, yield to a slumber deep."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What difference does it make? Dreams, like prayers, all prove vain."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lest idle tears should trace a fruitless way,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This vow within my heart — I must embrace."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though brief the moment, a moment's fleeting grace,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I must let this burning heart beat with fervent pace;"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And let this passion, my soul's consuming shroud"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Forge a beacon. May it shine bright and bold; a brief beam to bid Elysium unfold."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a4820a4ec1764652"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->Have you beheld a dream more bright than gold?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Can you recall the paths of hate, of love?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The twilight clouds in dusk's embrace unfold,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The evening breeze scatters the light smoke above."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Time flies, and bygone days depart."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do you still recall, or has memory flown?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet still, someone must light the beacon's spark"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even on snow-clad fields and borderlands stark."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ea19f6cfa4729025"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "VIII"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Covered in the pale, frost-colored moonlight,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The valiant warrior journeyed to a foreign shore."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Countless souls lie buried within the ancient ruins,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Innumerable heroes faded where mists now stray."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The dark tide of monsters galloped across the desolate expanse,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Trampling upon the hopes of all the living."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Thus did the Nightingale forge the first beam of light upon the summit,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Subduing the insatiable delirium."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bf44782f974e737b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->The biting gale blew with fervor, whilst the calamity was cast into the blackened light."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He caught a fleeting glance of the still dawn, a glimpse of the eternal yesterday,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fate traversed the winds, between the living and the dead."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the long night, the sound of the lyre was akin to the fragrance of blossoms in the first stirring of spring."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Parting the snow-curtain of the sky, The Nightingale would sing in praise of the sun."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-969d8afa1bcb9ac5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->A generation akin to thunder's roar,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A generation steadfast as pine and cypress,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A generation resembling the mighty tide,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A generation fierce as the tempestuous wind,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Inherited this name through the ages."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-926709d0d134744b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a1fcc2bb2b30fe1e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->— Sergei Semyonovich Mayakov —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "III"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An unequal mortal duel, a hopeless deathmatch,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Relentless, pitch-black, towering waves loomed on one side,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Whilst an aged and feeble soul stood upon the other,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A weapon gripped tightly in his hand."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c65913a222948d95"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->The voice in the mist spoke to him thus:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You blind, reckless, malicious fool."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do you have no care for the companions who trusted you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You, Mayakov, you arrogant madman,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was for your vile glory that"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You let the young lads lose their lives."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Their mothers will never see their sons again,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Nor their sons, their fathers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How pitiful, the orphans you adopted so hypocritically,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They once again must endure the bitter anguish of losing a father."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Why didn't you send out a distress signal?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Why did you let the Lighthouse fall?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Why strip the hope from your brethren?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let them face death in desolation?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An old man, who knows not the limits of his own strength!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They all perished for your lofty ambitions,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And none remain to lay their bones to rest."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear, dear Mayakov, yield now."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For the sake of peace, let their souls find redemption."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b92541d63047e332"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "-->He faced the ocean, shadowed by his gloom,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And with his hand, he shined his axe anew."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-841dae881a664170"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
